.TH GTA6_PATCHER 1 "November 2026" "Tofa7aElSafa7a Leak" "Cyberus Linux Quest Manual"
.SH NAME
gta6_patcher \- strip digital-only DRM from the leaked GTA VI build and generate a physical disc stream
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B /challenge/gta6_patcher
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B /challenge/gta6_patcher
verifies the patched GTA VI folder inside
.I ~/gta6_leak/physical_disc_edition/
and outputs the physical disc build stream on standard error (\fBstderr\fR).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-verify\-drm
Check current Rockstar digital storefront lock status.
.TP
.BR \-b ", " \-\-burn\-disc
Strip digital-only DRM and emit the physical disc build stream on stderr.
.TP
.BR \-t ", " \-\-telemetry
Run dummy online telemetry diagnostics.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Display usage information and exit.
.SH AUTHOR
Leaked by an old member of the Tofa7aElSafa7a group.
